# dependencies
node_modules

# build output
dist

# NOTE: `drizzle/` was previously ignored here, which meant the migration
# history and drizzle/meta/_journal.json existed only on one developer's
# machine. Fresh clones could not run `drizzle-kit generate` or `migrate`
# (no journal), and `migrate` additionally aborted because the journal
# referenced 0015, whose SQL file was never committed. Migrations and their
# snapshots are now versioned on purpose: they are the schema's history.
# Local-only artefacts that may still be ignored in future:
#   drizzle/meta/          (only if a team decides to regenerate snapshots)
#   drizzle/*_journal.json (never — this is what `migrate` reads)

